# S3, shader bank family B: noise and post-processing (12 October 2026)

Family B of the procedural shader bank now holds 39 blocks: noise, grain, dithering, single-pass analytic optics (bloom, blur, defocus, chromatic aberration, flares), colour grading and tone mapping, mask transitions, and colour transitions over time in OKLab. Each block is a pure GLSL ES 3.0 function with a numpy twin. The verifier is green on all 39, and a deliberately broken copy turns red. No reference pixel, logo or text is used anywhere. (12 October 2026)

