## What remains (12 October 2026)

- **No multi-pass effects.** `compose` cannot feed one layer into a filter. A real image-space bloom or blur of an arbitrary composite would need a filter-layer concept in `compose` and a render-to-texture step. The `<id>_apply` helpers are ready for that.
- **GPU path tested only on ANGLE Metal.** SwiftShader was not measured (same limit as S0).
